3. THE IDEOLOGICAL MONEY PUMP (IMP)

This license includes the Ideological Money Pump (IMP). In this section:

  "SophiOS" means the operating system described in the Work, and any
  software, product or service derived from it in whole or in part.

  "Profit" means revenue received from SophiOS, less the reasonable,
  documented direct costs of earning that revenue.

  "Those less fortunate" means people in need of material support, whether
  helped directly or through a charitable organization that serves them.

(a) The requirement. If you derive Profit from SophiOS, you must give AT
    LEAST ten percent (10%) of that Profit to those less fortunate.

(b) Timing and records. Give at least once per calendar year in which you
    derive Profit. Keep records of what you earned and what you gave, and
    share them on reasonable request.

(c) No self-dealing. Gifts to yourself, your employees, or any person or
    organization you control do not count toward the 10%.

(d) It travels with the Work. Anyone to whom you distribute SophiOS, or
    something derived from it, must receive it under this license, including
    this section 3.

(e) No Profit, no obligation. Use that earns no Profit owes nothing under
    this section.

(f) More is welcome. Ten percent is the minimum, not the limit.

